{"title":"Nakakapagpabagabag","artist":"Dasu","sourceId":"reference:krh6Yu4DS4eiR0mvGoAh","sourceHash":"8cc2a62d042a2a4eee598925d119e452166c76872b30004983736ac6f74d775b","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":25.84,"end":28.84,"text":"Kamusta? bakit tila dumatal ang kaba?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":29.04,"end":32.04,"text":"Ano ba ang agam-agam na bumabagabag?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":32.54,"end":35.54,"text":"Ang dinadamdam nila'y mahirap ipinta","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":35.64,"end":38.64,"text":"Bakit ba ako nagtataka?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":38.88,"end":41.88,"text":"Ako ba'ng may kasalanan kung bakit na iwan sila?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.34,"end":45.34,"text":"Ako nga itong nagpaparaya para sa adhikaing walang patutunguhan-","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":47.01,"end":49.07,"text":"O, Kay saklap","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":49.07,"end":52.07,"text":"Pa'no ba tayo magkakaisa?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":55.62,"end":58.62,"text":"Sinabihan na kitang tumakbo papalayo sa mundong","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":59.92,"end":62.34,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":62.34,"end":65.34,"text":"Pinilit kong sagipin ang mga naliligaw sa dilim","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":66.56,"end":68.78,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":68.78,"end":71.78,"text":"Naniwala pa ako sa sinungaling mong mga luha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":73.19,"end":75.58,"text":"\"Ngunit mahal pa rin kita\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":75.58,"end":78.58,"text":"Kasalanan ko paba na 'di mo na ako makikita?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":79.72,"end":82.72,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":83.02,"end":86.02,"text":"Mas sanay na akong maglakad ng nakapiring ang aking mata","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":86.08,"end":88.28,"text":"Habang buhay ko nang pinagsisisihan","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":88.28,"end":91.28,"text":"Na iniwan ang tanging sidha sa puso","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":91.4,"end":92.9,"text":"Naglahong parang usok","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":92.9,"end":95.9,"text":"'Di na maibabalik pa","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":96.06,"end":99.06,"text":"Parang sa panaghinip ko lang masisilayan ang mukha nila","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":99.33,"end":102.33,"text":"\"Parang awa mo na hindi na mauulit ang panganib\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":102.86,"end":105.86,"text":"Masarap makinig sa inyong mga paghihinagpis","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":107.02000000000001,"end":109.45,"text":"Na tila ubod ng tamis","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":109.45,"end":112.45,"text":"Sinabihan ko silang bilisan ang pagtakbo sa mundong","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":113.55,"end":116.28,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":116.28,"end":119.28,"text":"Di sila nakikinig ngunit ngayo'y nagmamakaawa","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":120.27,"end":122.86,"text":"Nagpapatawa ba sila?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":122.86,"end":125.86,"text":"Naniwala pa ako sa sinungaling n'yong mga mata","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":127.07,"end":129.36,"text":"\"Ngunit kami'y mali rin ba?\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":129.36,"end":132.36,"text":"Sino nga lang ba ako para iligtas ang inyong diwa?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":133.32,"end":136.32,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":136.41,"end":139.41,"text":"Bakit ba ako nababahala sa mundong ito?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":140.15,"end":142.54,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag ba?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":142.54,"end":145.54,"text":"Pinilit kong sagipin ngunit sila'y nasakop na ng dilim","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":146.88,"end":149.25,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":149.25,"end":152.25,"text":"Naniwala pa ako sa sinungaling mong mga luha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":153.59,"end":155.72,"text":"\"Ngunit huli na ang lahat!\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":155.72,"end":158.72,"text":"Kasalanan ko pa ba na di mo na ako makikita?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":159.98,"end":162.98,"text":"Nakakapagpabagabag!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}